      "short": "$h=9\\text{ cm}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}A&=2\\pi rh\\\\90\\pi&=2\\pi(5)h\\\\90\\pi&=10\\pi h\\\\h&=\\frac{90\\pi}{10\\pi}\\\\h&=9\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
